# TEMPLATE v1.5, 2026-07-30 (v1.5 adds the audit-artifact block).
# Fleet kit and session files: local-only, never committed.
# Fleet meta (Luca, the Handler, sibling sites) stays off GitHub, both buckets.
# The spoke renames this file to .gitignore at the repo root BEFORE the first commit.
CLAUDE.md
plan.md
design-constraints.md
design-brief-skeleton.md
imagery.md
stack.md
bootstrap-instructions.md
siteground-sheet.md
pre-flight.md
initial-prompt.md
operator-brief.md
design-brief.md
memory.md
handoff-to-handler.md
/deploy.yml

# Externally fed sites only: the ingest doctrine and whatever contract document the
# producer's owner supplied. Both are fleet meta. If this site's contract file has a
# different name, add it here before the first commit.
ingest.md
INGEST_CONTRACT.md

# Runtime secrets and the server-only store. The real ingest token lives ONLY on the
# server (private/ingest-config.php, above the web root) and the store is never in the
# repo, but ignore both defensively in case a local test copy ever appears.
ingest-config.php
/private/

# Kit-source copies that live at the repo ROOT: the spoke moves these into place
# (ads.txt to public/ads.txt, security-headers.htaccess merged into
# public/.htaccess, this file to .gitignore), but a lingering root copy must never
# be committed. The leading slash anchors to root, so the served public/ads.txt,
# public/.htaccess and the real .gitignore stay tracked.
/ads.txt
/gitignore
/security-headers.htaccess

# Audit artifacts: the link-checker and the judgment-track routine write reports,
# logs and caches on every run. They are working output, they change on every run,
# and they hold the site's full URL inventory plus whatever error text the remote
# servers returned. Ignore them BEFORE the first local run, otherwise the first
# audit turns into a commit nobody wanted. If this site's checker writes somewhere
# else, add that path here and tell Luca so the doctrine default can follow.
/audit/
/reports/
link-check-report.*
audit-report.*
*.audit.json

# Harness profile dir: spokes are told never to persist here, but if one does,
# it must never leak to GitHub.
.claude/

# NOT ignored on purpose (the repo carries strictly the site):
# public/ (incl. public/ads.txt), data/, .github/workflows/deploy.yml, .gitignore itself.

# OS noise
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store

# Python bytecode from the local checker and its rule tests
__pycache__/
*.pyc
